title: TalkToArmorer
---
The armorer's shop. I can help with protection.
-> Browse wares (buy / sell gear).
    <<command: OpenShop "armorer">>
-> Upgrade my armor.
    <<command: OpenUpgrade "armorer">>
-> Craft some gear.
    <<command: OpenCraft "armorer">>
-> Manage my equipment.
    <<command: OpenEquip>>
-> That's all.
    Stay safe out there.
===
